<title>USA: Green Oasis hires financial adviser.</title>
<headline>Green Oasis hires financial adviser.</headline>
<dateline>CHARLESTON, S.C. 1996-09-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Green Oasis Environmental Inc said Wednesday it has hired an adviser to help the company grow and develop.</p>
<p>Under an agreement with the firm, which is described as being a member of the New York Stock Exchange, neither its name nor the value of its contract can be disclosed, a spokesman for Green Oasis Environmental said.</p>
<p>Green Oasis produces synthetic fuels from waste motor oil using a patent-pending process.</p>
